  message: "2026-10-03 stage 6 (fovus+hizon+pokij), branch jgstern-agent/fix/fovus (base 604c91e3f2): commits 66db748de9 (red tests), b3d079d9f0 (fix), 11ccccc953 (test made behavioural). One shared source: taxonomy.extension_globs / extension_suffixes / js_ts_language_for_path / grammar_for_path over LANGUAGES; DDG specs default to their language's taxonomy extensions (python *.py, c *.c declared narrowings), .tsx parsed with the tsx grammar; 12 JS/TS linkers read the shared list; annotation_convention labels via taxonomy.get_language. Gates: test_js_ts_extension_single_source.py (no private JS/TS list in linkers/ddg_build; language_from_path callers shrink-only) and test_js_ts_ddg_extension_reach.py (no undeclared DDG spec narrowing; js_ts.py parity). Board smart-test: 9011 passed, 0 failed, changed sources at 100% coverage; red run on the tests-only commit 39 failed / 2 errors. Corpus: growthbook .tsx functions with DDG edges 0->2090 of 6204 (ddg_edges 35552->61430); apollo-server +14 linker nodes / +11 edges in .mjs/.cjs/.mts/.cts (1 FP, pre-existing scanner defect WI-fihah); growthbook +4 nodes / +18 edges in .tsx (1 template-literal FP, noted on WI-filup). Taint-verdict A/B NOT run. Residuals filed: WI-midik (other languages), WI-zahom (phoenix_ipc/openapi grammar labels), WI-sunub (non-linker core lists), WI-gimis (annotation duplicate ids), WI-fihah (Query.if). Full report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/fovus.md"  # 88c7
